---
import { TextSection } from '@littlesticks/odyssey-theme-components';
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { Button } from '@littlesticks/odyssey-theme-components';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon';

const seo = {
  title: `Reviews | SCV Pet Care`,
  description: `Client reviews of SCV Pet Care's services`,
};
---

<Layout seo={seo}>
  <TextSection narrow>
    <h1>Client Reviews</h1>

    <h2>What Our Clients Say</h2>

    <div class="review">
      <h3>Dr. Shannon Gaharan, DVM</h3>
      <p>
        My husband and I are so grateful to have worked with Jaimie! She helped
        our dog Stella improve her aggressive behavior toward other dogs. After
        a few weeks of clicker training and carefully socializing her, Stella
        made a huge improvement. Jaimie is dedicated and caring, and she will go
        to all ends to improve a pet's behavior and also teach their owners.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="review">
      <h3>Ryan Gilley</h3>
      <p>
        3 years ago Finn came into my life, and I was worried because German
        Shepherds are a smart breed with amazing talents. I've never had
        anything other than labs, so I decided it was in mine and Finn's best
        interest to have a trainer help me. I reached out to Jaimie Garber with
        SCV Pet Care, and not only was their service top-notch, but their
        background, experience, and care they spend with your pet. Finn is the
        most behaved, knows not to jump on people, public friendly, and safe. If
        you need a trainer, I highly recommend SCV Pet Care.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="review">
      <h3>Michele Tenenberg</h3>
      <p>
        Thank God for Jaimie and her excellent training. Maverick learned so
        much... So did I... I could not have survived his puppiness if I had not
        found Jaimie.
      </p>
    </div>


    <div class="review">
        <h3>Sharlyn Harley</h3>
        <p>
            Jamie was a tremendous help with our new rescue dog, Sam (Samantha)! Her insight into animal behavior was instrumental in dealing with some of the issues we faced with Sam. Jaimie gave us practical tips for helping Sam to settle in with visiting family members, taking Sam on a last-minute road trip, and also gave us basic training tips which have helped ALL of us!

            Jaimie thoughtfully listened to what our concerns were and then had perfect solutions for how to address them, and the change in Sam has been noticeable.
            
            Thank you, Jaimie!
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>L. Carlson</h3>
        <p>
            Jaime is a top-notch trainer. She understands dog behavior and considers the big picture. By that I mean she asks all the right questions about prior training and what you may be doing now. She also discusses any issues you are having with the dog and pinpoints methods to help your dog reach his/her potential. She’s professional and really understands how to meet your goals. My dog (and I) have learned a lot and improved significantly with her guidance.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Poul Schillemat</h3>
        <p>
          The dog training was amazing, tailored to exactly what we needed.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Samantha Frieze</h3>
        <p>
            I had never owned a dog before and brought home two 9 week old puppies, that were littermates. I felt very overwhelmed at first, but with Jaimie Garber's expertise, I have been able to implement commands like, sit,stay,come, I have had success in potty and crate training. They now are about 7 months old, and they are very well behaved. We take walks on the leash, have lots of interaction with other dogs. They travel very well while crated in the car. I couldnt have done it without Jamie's patience and knowledge . I really appreciate working with her. I would highly recommend her to anyone looking for an exceptional trainer.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Steph Burkhart</h3>
        <p>
            Jaime was highly recommended by a neighbor and since Ollie was a puppy, and a handful, we reached out to her. We were used to having a dog, but our previous dog was a low key Golden and Ollie was a high strung puppy.

            Jaime gave us the structure we needed for Ollie. Her tips and instruction was spot on. She was very professional. The whole family benefited from her guidance and knowledge. She provided us with timely hands-on tips. She was very patient with us. We had four lessons and we all learned how to manage Ollie’s puppy behavior. We appreciated her flexibility as our family has a challenging schedule, All of us were very satisfied with the results after the training. We highly recommend Jaime.
            Positive
            Responsiveness, Reliability, Quality, Professionalism, Value
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Danielle Powell</h3>
        <p>
            Jamie is exceptional at caring and training dogs. She listened to our concerns and needs. She had patience with us and the dogs. We saw immediant results by using the training tools she gave us. Clear communication and flexible scheduling. Would definetly recommend the 4 session package.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Roxanne McManus</h3>
        <p>
            Positive
            Responsiveness, Reliability, Quality, Professionalism, Value        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Lizzie Winburne</h3>
        <p>
            I have teacup Yorkie name Cody, I wanted Cody to learn the different commands, such as Stop,sit, stay, wait, come, lay down, hand, wave, quiet, park, speak.
            Jaimie started to train Cody when Cody was 4 months old, Jamie knows the dogs behavior so well that Cody learned the command on one try, Jamie comes to our house to work with Cody, and every time I say the name Jaimie Cody get so excited and run to the front door and bark🤣 I would definitely highly recommend Jaimie to work with your dog, I still have Jaimie come time to time to work with Cody
            
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Kelly Thomson</h3>
        <p>
            Jaimie did an awesome job helping us with our large & very strong rescue puppy! We needed some training and so did he, but with Jaimie’s help we are all doing pretty good!! Thank you so much for coming to our home and helping us!!
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Marty Capoccia</h3>
        <p>
            Professional....professional...professional. Justin is a pleasure to work with. He is patient and communicates his wealth of knowledge in ways and examples that stick with you and your pet. Our dog is greatly improved, the rest is up to us, practice what you learn and we'll have the we'll behaved dog we can enjoy forever.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Joan Runyon</h3>
        <p>
          So worth hiring Jamie and following her simple and doable solutions.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Joe Ferndino</h3>
        <p>
          Thanks to Jaimie, we have a well-trained dog. She did a great job
          showing us how to train Bueller from his puppy days through his current
          young adult days. We strongly recommend her services.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Collette Lash</h3>
        <p>
            We were experiencing difficulties getting our senior dogs acclimated with our newly adopted younger dog. SCV Pet Care & Dog Training helped get everyone working together. The new dog also went through some basic training and is such a well behaved boy now, no more destroyed remote controls!
            We have also had the pet care when we were working late or out of town. It was wonderful receiving photos of our dogs and updates. We always feel confident that they are getting the best attention when we are away. Jaimie is so knowledgeable in all areas of the field, we trust only her care, training and advice!
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="review">
        <h3>Ara Printsian</h3>
